    "cls_id": "CH06122",
    "sub_id": "84051",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>In-Class Worksheets為每週之課堂作業，學生若缺席無法補交。Group Preject Presentation 為10分鐘之小組(4人)期末報告，包括口語及文字兩部份。Absence -1 point/hour (無故出席每小時扣一分。) Tardy -0.5 points/class (遲到每堂課扣0.5分。) Excellent Attendance (No absences and tardiness) +3 points/semester (全勤並且無遲到紀錄，學期總成績加3分。) Cell phones can only be used under the direction of the instructor for academic activities. (在老師的指導下，基於課堂上的學習活動，學生方可使用手機。)</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "Absence -1 point/hour (無故出席每小時扣一分。) Tardy -0.5 points/class (遲到每堂課扣0.5分。) Excellent Attendance (No absences and tardiness) +3 points/semester (全勤並且無遲到紀錄，學期總成績加3分。) Cell phones can only be used under the direction of the instructor for academic activities. (在老師的指導下，基於課堂上的學習活動，學生方可使用手機。)",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "Absence -1 point/hour (無故出席每小時扣一分。) Tardy -0.5 points/class (遲到每堂課扣0.5分。) Excellent Attendance (No absences and tardiness) +3 points/semester (全勤並且無遲到紀錄，學期總成績加3分。) Cell phones can only be used under the direction of the instructor for academic activities. (在老師的指導下，基於課堂上的學習活動，學生方可使用手機。)",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>本課程以小組合作進行英語教學理論之探討，師生課堂問答時，同組同學應互相支援，每位組員需表現相同之貢獻度於期末報告之完成。課堂小組討論時，應以討論主題為主。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
